602
01:00:23,870 --> 01:00:24,670
[Fai]: It’s really good.

603
01:00:37,700 --> 01:00:38,930
Let’s take a picture together.

604
01:00:41,600 --> 01:00:42,620
Come on.

605
01:00:44,700 --> 01:00:45,500
Ready?

606
01:00:52,170 --> 01:00:54,670
